abstract: >-
  ReEKF-SORT is a motion-only online multi-object tracker for non-linear pedestrian
  motion and occlusion. It keeps the SORT-style tracking-by-detection workflow,
  replaces the linear motion state with a speed-angle extended Kalman filter, and
  adds causal virtual observations plus confidence-continuity association.

title: "Online multi-object occlusion tracking based on causal motion prediction and confidence-continuity association"
